Story: Keep a drone in the air
  As a commander of a team
  I want to recharge a drone at its base
  So that it flies for the whole game

  In the [[v4 rules]], a drone recharges slowly while it circles over its base. A drone that lands
  gets a new battery from the ground crew in 30 s. Circle when you cannot spare the drone for long,
  and land when you can.

  Scenario: Recharge over the base, then land for a swap
    Given the batteries are on
    And the battery swap is on
    And the battery of the first Blue drone is 100 s
    And the first Blue drone is over its base
    When the first Blue drone circles over its base for 25 seconds
    Then the battery of the first Blue drone is 175 s
    When the first Blue drone lands at its base
    Then the condition of the first Blue drone is on the ground
    When the game runs for 30 seconds
    Then the battery of the first Blue drone is 240 s
